// Ghost-Man maze: 31 rows of 28 columns, one line per row.
//   #  wall               .  pellet            o  power pellet
//   =  ghost-house door   P  Pac-Man's start   (space) floor, no pellet
// A row open at both ends is a wrap-around tunnel. Leave the ghost house
// in the middle, and the ring of floor around it, exactly as they are.
// Levels play in file-name order, then start over.
name: CROSSROADS

